	'- **Player:** 100 health (regenerates 3/s after 6 s without damage), 100 mana (6/s after 1.5 s), speed 750, dash 7 m in 0.18 s every 1.2 s. Health and mana stay at 100 for the whole game (no levels), so every hit reads as a percentage (\u00a719).');
rep('- **Guns:** pistol 18 damage, 12 rounds, 4 spare magazines; shotgun 8 pellets of 10, 6 rounds, strong up close; rifle automatic, 14 damage, 30 rounds, stronger far away. Headshots: pistol x2, shotgun and rifle x1.5.',
	'- **Guns (v0.26):** pistol 20 damage every 0.25 s, 15 rounds, 6 spare magazines; shotgun 8 pellets of 10 every 0.8 s, 6 rounds, 4 spare, strong up close; rifle automatic, 12 damage every 0.1 s, 30 rounds, 5 spare, stronger far away. Headshots: pistol x2, shotgun and rifle x1.5. Elemental sword 50 every 0.5 s. Why: \u00a719.');
rep('- **Enemies:** past orc 60 health, melee 12; future orc 70 health, ranged 9; brute (sub-boss placeholder) 320 health, melee 28.',
	'- **Enemies:** see the templates in \u00a719 (v0.26).');
rep('Ignite 4 s, 6 fire damage every 0.5 s (48 in total), then 3 s immune. Shock: a 10 lightning damage discharge and a 1.2 s stun, then 4 s immune.',
	"Ignite 4 s, 5 fire damage every 0.5 s (40 in total, times each enemy's `IgniteDamageMult`), then 3 s immune. Shock: a 15 lightning damage discharge and a 1.2 s stun, then 4 s immune.");
rep('- **Build-up per source (first pass):** fireball 40 (25-55 with QTE power), fire wall 10 per 0.5 s tick, flamethrower 8 per 0.3 s tick, lightning bolt 35 (20-50), lightning rune 60 (35-85), static orb 8 per tick, ice floor 5 per 0.5 s tick (60 at most over its 6 s, so it never fills the bar alone), electric grenade 60. Weapons per hit: pistol 15, shotgun 25 per shot, rifle 8, elemental sword 20, ember staff 10 (fire). Weak point bonus x1.5.',
	'- **Build-up per source (v0.26):** fireball 40 (25-55 with QTE power), fire wall 15 per 0.25 s tick, flamethrower 8 per 0.3 s tick, lightning bolt 35 (20-50), lightning rune 60 (35-85), static orb 12 per tick, ice floor 5 per 0.5 s tick (60 at most over its 6 s, so it never fills the bar alone), electric grenade 60. Weapons per hit: pistol 15, shotgun 40 per shot, rifle 6, elemental sword 25, ember staff 18 (fire): every weapon fills about 50-60 per second of fire. Weak point bonus x1.5.');
rep('- **Enemies (first pass):** the castle orc uses the defaults. The orc brute (sub-boss) takes 20% less fire damage and 25% less fire build-up, its thresholds are higher (fire 160, lightning 200, ice 180), a shock only interrupts its attack and Frost only slows it (50%). The armored orc takes 25% more lightning damage and lightning build-up and 25% less fire build-up.',
	'- **Enemies:** resistances, weaknesses and thresholds per enemy are in \u00a719 (v0.26).');
rep('- Every spell number in `Spells.json`.', '- Every spell number in `Spells.json`; the v0.26 values and their reasons are in \u00a719.');

let section = fs.readFileSync(path.join(__dirname, 'gdd_section19.md'), 'utf8').split('\r\n').join('\n');
t = t.replace(/\s*$/, '\n') + section;
if (crlf) { t = t.split('\n').join('\r\n'); }
fs.writeFileSync(f, t);
console.log('ok');

