Owner's request: balance all numbers with maths (tree percentages untouched), no bullet sponges, waves 60-90 s, Valkyries about 2 min, final boss about 3 min, a build and not the whole tree, and no hardcoded values.

- Tools/Balance/balance_model.js: reads the data files and prints weapons, spells, six reference builds with perks applied, time to kill, ammo and mana economy, pressure per sub-wave, encounter lengths and the skill point sum.
- Data: guns evened out (pistol 20 every 0.25 s with 15 rounds, rifle 12), ammo carried and dropped, spell cooldowns and damage (control spells up about half the time), fire wall ticks every 0.25 s, 15 enemy entries (swarm, soldier, elite, slow tank, sub-bosses, Valkyries, Entity) with weaknesses, resistances, thresholds and Ignite scaling, 19 encounters giving 36 points with the 2 at the start.
- Code (Muse Spark): about 25 literals now read from Game, Player, Items, QTE, Spells and Enemies data with their old values. Architect: per-enemy status resistance (<EffectId>Taken, used as SlowTaken), staff projectile lifetime from data, two compile fixes.
- Reviewed by GPT-6-Astra (medium) before the first build: builds calculated from perks, ammo limit in boss maths, real time of the QTE, mana delay, attack windup; Valkyries 7,200 and 7,600 health, fifth sub-wave, lower magazine drops, longer ice cooldowns.
- Built once, 36 tests green, smoke run clean. Not packaged (the architect chat packages next). Needs play-testing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
EOF
